{
  "id": "u09-l01",
  "unit": "u09-past",
  "title": "I did",
  "status": "draft",
  "tip": "The simple past for **আমি** (and **আমরা**) is verb stem + **-লাম** (*-lam*):\n\n- করা → **করলাম** 'I did'\n- দেখা → **দেখলাম** 'I saw / watched'\n- কেনা → **কিনলাম** 'I bought' (note the raised vowel, like কিনব)\n- শোনা → **শুনলাম** 'I heard'\n\n**গতকাল** (*gotokal*) is 'yesterday'. Plain **কাল** means *either* yesterday or tomorrow — the verb tense tells you which.\n\n**তাকে** (*take*) is 'him / her' as an object: **আমি তাকে বললাম** 'I told him/her'.",
  "vocab": [
